export anchor AudioWorkstationStyle:
    number: 312
    screen: OpsMonitor
    name: Audio workstation
    idea: A music workstation session, an arrangement of tracks for requests, errors, latency, deploy clips, the incident region and alert markers under a playhead, and a mixer with one channel strip, meter and fader per service.
    base: dark
    palette:
        studio: #141518, the page
        panel: #1f2024, the arrangement and mixer frames
        header: #26272c, track headers, channel strips and title rows
        lane: #1a1b1e, track lanes with an hour grid
        rule: #34363c, lane and panel borders
        ink: #ececef, text
        muted: #a3a6ae, labels and the ruler
        teal: #3fc1b0, the requests waveform and the primary button
        violet: #a48bff, the latency track and deploy clips
        amber: #ffb547, the incident region, Degraded and the master bus
        red: #ff7070, the error track and Firing
        green: #6bdc8b, Healthy and Resolved
        sky: #7cc4ff, Recovered and p50
        lcd: #b8f5a0, the time display
        playhead: #ffd84a, the playhead and focus
    type:
        System sans, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial,
        at 13px and 1.4, with ui-monospace, SF Mono, Menlo, Consolas for the
        time display, values, clips and scribble strips. The time display
        is 20px mono at 600 in LCD green, the incident number 20px mono
        bold amber, channel values 15px mono, region labels 11px at 600.
    layout:
        A transport bar holds Brightwork Ops session, the apps as folder
        tabs, three transport buttons, an LCD reading 07.48.00 playhead
        billing 5xx and Production last 24 hours. The arrangement panel
        has a 168px header column and a 960px timeline at 40px per hour
        with an hour ruler. Tracks are Requests as a mirrored teal
        waveform region, Error rate with the spike, Latency with p95 solid
        and p50 dashed, Deploys as three staggered clips ending at their
        times, Incident as an amber region from 06.58, and Alerts as
        markers with shapes. A yellow playhead stands at 07.48. Each
        region has a dark label chip. The mixer has five channel strips,
        each with a status button, two meters and a fader on a 99 to 100
        percent scale, uptime, the metric and a coloured scribble strip,
        then a wider amber master bus strip for the incident. Markers and
        clips lists close the screen. The timeline scrolls sideways inside
        its panel on small screens, strips go three then two across.
    spacing: A 4px unit. 6 to 10px padding, 12px between panels, 40px per hour.
    density: Dense. Seven lanes and six strips on one screen.
    corners: 6px panels, 4px regions, clips, buttons and folder tabs.
    borders: 1px #34363c, regions carry a lighter border of their own colour, clips a 3px edge at their time.
    shadows: Only under fader caps.
    icons:
        14px status shapes on channel buttons, markers and lists, a ringed
        tick for Healthy, a triangle for Degraded, a circular arrow for
        Recovered, a bolt for Firing, a tick for Resolved and a magnifier
        for Investigating, plus start, play and flag transport glyphs.
    focus: A 2px yellow outline offset 2px.
    tone: Studio terms, such as Session, Arrangement, Clips, Markers, Mixer and Master bus.
